reviewTips.suggestion:
[重构思路] 抽出 static 内部函数承载公共赋值，方向只作为参数传入；公共 API 保留薄封装。代码示例：
```c
static void animimg_set_src_internal(lv_obj_t * obj, const void * dsc[], size_t num, bool reverse)
{
    LV_ASSERT_OBJ(obj, MY_CLASS);
    lv_animimg_t * animimg = (lv_animimg_t *)obj;
    animimg->dsc = dsc;
    animimg->pic_count = num;
    if(reverse) lv_anim_set_values(&animimg->anim, (int32_t)num, 0);
    else lv_anim_set_values(&animimg->anim, 0, (int32_t)num);
}

void lv_animimg_set_src(lv_obj_t * obj, const void * dsc[], size_t num)
{
    animimg_set_src_internal(obj, dsc, num, false);
}

void lv_animimg_set_src_reverse(lv_obj_t * obj, const void * dsc[], size_t num)
{
    animimg_set_src_internal(obj, dsc, num, true);
}
```
